==Battleground==
*1 [[Sir Rel]] spawns after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Sir Rel]] spawns.
**3 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Kill the starting Sir Rels and Doge Darks for money, then spawn a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to kill the shy boy along with its support, then rush down Director Kurosawah. If done right, Kurosawah will die before Bun Bun Symbiote even spawns.

